<h1 class=wide>{{ bbb.title }}</h1>
<article class=two-thirds>
	<p>The Barrio’s Bards Banquet is a monthly show where we discuss and share practices of clownery to cross-pollinate and burst bubbles.</p>
	<p>This meetup (<q>banquet</q>) welcomes bards, jesters, and clowns inhabit niches and are fascinated by weird practices. In particular, we’ll be reflecting on the role of the neighbourhood (<q>barrio</q>) in any sort of endeavour.</p>
	<p>In an era of macroscopic and overwhelming challenges, addressing crises in a local context, <strong>from below</strong>, is a radical act. This gathering aims at fostering intergalactic collaborations amongst jesters who share this goal.</p>
	<div class='flex'>
